    "created_at": "2020-01-14T18:53:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-01-14T18:53:00Z",
    "body": "> The 2 lines should be rendered at once and then displayed.\r\n\r\nTry typing `sleep 1` and pressing enter. Does it make sense that at first everything is moved up one line and after one second everything is moved up another line? An empty command is essentially `sleep 0`, so everything happens faster.",
