    "created_at": "2020-01-14T18:54:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-01-14T18:54:34Z",
    "body": "> I have the same issue on 2 machines regardless of the terminal used. It's also worth noting that Powerlevel10k doesn't have this issue at all. When you press return, the update is instant.\r\n\r\nIt still happens in two steps in powerlevel10k. The difference is that powerlevel10k is faster at rendering the next prompt, so you don't have enough time to notice the terminal in the state where everything has been moved one line up but not two lines up yet.",
