    "updated_at": "2020-01-14T19:03:17Z",
    "body": "> That might be the case, but the issue still exists.\r\n\r\nLet's verify this.\r\n\r\nUse https://github.com/romkatv/zsh-prompt-benchmark to measure prompt latency with powerlevel10k and starship. If starship has higher latency (`S`) than powerlevel10k (`P`), then check if you can observe the same issue in powerlevel10k if you use `sleep $((S-P))` instead of an empty command. If this all checks out, then the issue can be rephrased as \"please make starship faster\". It's not necessarily easier but at least it's clear what is being requested.",
